{"c":[{"name":"20260825T003337Z-7415cd62d790d57b","text":"Skip a root wake when a == SumMem Usage == block is still readable; do not skip on a remembered wake or the footer alone.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T003343Z-32520d7e11eb7ac8","text":"A consumer upgrade is copying the script; replace an old fat AGENTS.md prefix once. init prints the bootstrap and writes nothing.","type":"note"}]}
